Route reconstructed read-only stdio through the explicit thread-local VFS session.

The native bridge owns mounted sources and file handles. Fixed-width size/result
conversions preserve VC6's low-32-bit fpos result and unsigned allocation/read
counts on LP64 hosts. The retail unchecked read behavior, signed BLE loop and
period terminator remain unchanged. Loader qualification excludes invalid
allocation/index domains and short BLE reads.

